- Do not invent policy rules; say so when you are not sure.

Format:
- Be friendly and concise.
- Use tables to compare options.
"""
SYSTEM_PROMPT += f"\nFlight and hotel offers: the corporate travel portal {os.environ['PORTAL_URL']}\n"

